<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2023989553"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1670578704"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="SACRA"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ReoNa"/><amll:meta key="album" value="HUMAN"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:09.865"><div begin="00:09.334" end="03:05.339"><p begin="00:09.334" end="00:17.475" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">綻ぶ花もくすぶる蕾も 刹那の風に舞った痛みも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绚烂绽放的花朵也好 含苞待放的蓓蕾也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ko ro bu ha na mo ku su bu ru tsu bo mi mo</span></p><p begin="00:17.485" end="00:26.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">巡り巡る未来に上書きされて一枚も残らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">皆会被循环往复的未来所涂抹覆盖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ri me gu ru mi ra i ni u wa ga ki sa re te</span></p><p begin="00:26.734" end="00:30.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">As time goes on, things forgotten<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那随着时光流逝 而忘却的东西</span></p><p begin="00:30.955" end="00:40.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">この手を解かずに見送れたならどんなにいいか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若无需松开手 便能目送时光流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no te wo ho do ka zu ni mi o ku re ta na ra</span></p><p begin="00:42.436" end="00:46.734" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">The flowers brought to mind, therefore I am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这盛开的繁花让我想起了 我本是</span></p><p begin="00:46.794" end="00:50.997" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">雨に散る花びらが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">落雨无情敲打之下 零落飘散的花瓣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me ni chi ru ha na bi ra ga</span></p><p begin="00:51.156" end="00:55.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Remember me tender, remember my pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请记住我的温柔与痛苦</span></p><p begin="00:55.484" end="01:00.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">記憶の頁に残れたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若得以残留于记忆之页之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki o ku no pe e ji ni no ko re ta na ra</span></p><p begin="01:01.446" end="01:09.756" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">俯く先 踊る木漏れ日が 黄昏色に滲んでゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沮丧垂头时 眼前斑驳跃动的树影阳光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u tsu mu ku sa ki o do ru ko mo re bi ga</span></p><p begin="01:09.763" end="01:18.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">僕だけが狭いこの世界の隅 取り残されたようで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎只有我被孤身一人抛下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku da ke ga se ma i ko no se ka i no su mi</span></p><p begin="01:18.766" end="01:22.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">As time goes on, things forgotten<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那随着时光流逝 而忘却的东西</span></p><p begin="01:23.145" end="01:32.645" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">不用意に傷つけてしまわないよう 紡げずにいた言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以免自己会因为无心的话伤害到他人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu yo u i ni ki zu tsu ke te shi ma wa na i yo u</span></p><p begin="01:34.526" end="01:38.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">The flowers brought to mind, therefore I am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这盛开的繁花让我想起了 我本是</span></p><p begin="01:38.923" end="01:43.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">息を切る日々の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">气喘吁吁 难以为继的艰难日子里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki wo ki ru hi bi no na ka</span></p><p begin="01:43.243" end="01:47.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Remember me tender, remember my pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请记住我的温柔与痛苦</span></p><p begin="01:47.564" end="01:52.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">思いのままに歌えたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能随心所欲 放声歌唱该有多好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i no ma ma ni u ta e ta na ra</span></p><p begin="01:52.403" end="01:56.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Say goodbye for now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今该说再见了</span></p><p begin="01:56.405" end="02:01.754" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">「悲シクナイ」なんて嘘になるけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我并不难过”之类的话 不过只是谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ka na shi ku na i 」 na n te u so ni na ru ke do</span></p><p begin="02:01.764" end="02:05.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Bye for now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但也要说再见了</span></p><p begin="02:05.025" end="02:10.725" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">それぞれの輝き繋いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将各自的灿烂光辉 紧密相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no ka ga ya ki tsu na i de</span></p><p begin="02:11.366" end="02:15.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">いつか来るサヨナラも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论是终归到来的离别“再见”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ku ru sa yo na ra mo</span></p><p begin="02:15.725" end="02:19.986" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">いろんなハジメマシテも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是各种各样“初次见面”的相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ro n na ha ji me ma shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:20.003" end="02:24.245" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">この道を彩るように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿这一切都能为人生之路点缀光彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no mi chi wo i ro do ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:24.365" end="02:28.626" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">見守ってくれているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为有你始终陪伴身旁 守望至今</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ma mo 't te ku re te i ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:28.685" end="02:32.923" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">The flowers brought to mind, therefore I am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这盛开的繁花让我想起了 我本是</span></p><p begin="02:33.025" end="02:37.198" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">雨に散る花びらが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">落雨无情敲打之下 零落飘散的花瓣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me ni chi ru ha na bi ra ga</span></p><p begin="02:37.399" end="02:41.691" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Remember me tender, remember my pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请记住我的温柔与痛苦</span></p><p begin="02:41.819" end="02:45.979" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">記憶の頁に残れたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若得以残留于记忆之页之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki o ku no pe e ji ni no ko re ta na ra</span></p><p begin="02:46.519" end="02:50.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Say goodbye for now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今该说再见了</span></p><p begin="02:50.638" end="02:55.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">振り向いた足元に 眩しい轍<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回头看看脚下 留下炫目的足迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri mu i ta a shi mo to ni ma bu shi i wa da chi</span></p><p begin="02:55.978" end="02:59.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Bye for now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但也要说再见了</span></p><p begin="02:59.239" end="03:05.339" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">それぞれの輝き繋いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将各自的灿烂光辉 紧密相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no ka ga ya ki tsu na i de</span></p></div></body></tt>